  bg('Burde and Dekimpe, Post-Lie algebra structures and generalized derivations of semisimple Lie algebras','https://homepage.univie.ac.at/Dietrich.Burde/papers/burde_44_postlie_der.pdf','Theorem 3.3 is the prior obstruction for solvable unimodular sources and nonzero semisimple targets.'),
